# An atom, which takes the data of its ρ, from an application.
#
#   ⟦ int ↦ ⟦ x ↦ ∅, inc ↦ ⟦ ρ ↦ ∅, λ ⤍ L_inc ⟧, φ ↦ ξ.x ⟧, foo ↦ Φ.int( x ↦ ⟦ Δ ⤍ 00-00-00-00-00-00-00-29 ⟧ ).inc ⟧
#
# The script below is printed by `phino sodg` 0.0.167.

F c0 int foo
F c1 x inc φ
F c2 ρ
λ c2 L_inc
P c1 inc c2
D c3 c1 x
P c1 φ c3
P c0 int c1
D c4 c0 int
F c5
Δ c5 00-00-00-00-00-00-00-29
A c6 c4 x c5
D c7 c6 inc
P c0 foo c7
